# Historical material that stays versioned but out of an unfiltered `rg` (#1017).
# `rg --no-ignore-dot` (or `--no-ignore`) searches it too.

# Contract releases: only the release in force, the highest version in
# schemas/releases.lock.json. Cutting a release moves this line to it.
# CI and tests still read older releases (scripts/validate_run_api.py validates against
# 2.0.0, for example): to trace what a validator or test reads, search with --no-ignore-dot.
/schemas/releases/*
!/schemas/releases/2.8.0/

/docs/evidence/
/docs/archive/
/openspec/changes/archive/
/odd/
/scripts/archive/
/compose/archive/
